      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same thing here! The issue appears to be more noticable on smaller avatars, but even taller avatars have the issue. With Kons it gets so bad the legs literally clip inside of the torso when crouched and prone turns you into a mole.\nTaller avatars usually just have a bit of leg clipping or knees a little bit too close to the ground, and mid height avatars seem to end up with the completely broken foot like you have right there.\nSeems the camera position on all avatars is lower as well, but I don't know if that's a cause or an effect.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
